@localhost = https://localhost:63295
@id = 1
@phone = 13000000000
@password = 1

### 添加用户（测试）
POST {{{{localhost}}}}/user/add HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "Phone": "13000000002"
}


### id 获取用户”基础信息”
GET {{localhost}}/user/i/{{id}} HTTP/1.1


### phone 获取用户”基础信息”
GET {{localhost}}/user/p/{{{phone}}} HTTP/1.1


###
GET {{localhost}}/user/a/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "Password": "{{password}}"
}


### code，如未注册则创建用户，反之则返回用户“基础信息”
#POST {{localhost}}/user/ql/{{code}} HTTP/1.1


### phone/password，登录
GET {{localhost}}/user/l/{{phone}}/{{password}} HTTP/1.1


### phone 获取用户收藏门店
#GET {{localhost}}/user/f/s/{{phone}} HTTP/1.1

### ======================== 门店 ===========================
### 获取所有门店信息
GET {{localhost}}/store/a HTTP/1.1


### ======================== 车辆 ===========================
### StoreId 获取门店所有车辆
GET {{localhost}}/vehicle/1 HTTP/1.1


### ======================== 订单 ===========================
### StoreId 查询单个订单
GET {{localhost}}/order/i/{{id}} HTTP/1.1


### StoreId 添加单个订单
POST {{localhost}}/order/a HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "StartingTime": "2024-10-23"
    "ExpectedReturnTime": "2024-10-24"
    "RentalLocation": "1"
    "LongTermLease": "false"
    "Deposit": "200"
    "Rent": "50"
    "Notes": ""
}
